Package: com.nucleartweaks.screen-nuke
Name: ScreenNuke
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
Recommends: preferenceloader
Maintainer: Spec
Author: Spec
Description: Shrink the whole UI so more content fits — continuous
 More-Space mode. A slider scales everything (text, icons, rows, panels)
 from 100% down to 55%, like rendering at a higher resolution and letting
 the display downscale: zero blur, pixel-exact, iOS-8-era "more room" feel.
 Optional extra-small system text on top. Settings slider; respring to
 re-apply everywhere.
Section: Tweaks
